  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto held a meeting at his Hambalang residence with ten former National Police chiefs representing various generations of the force. Among those present was the Minister of Home Affairs, who joined nine other retired officials for the discussion. The event served as a platform for the president to exchange views with the retired leadership regarding the internal state of the Indonesian National Police (Polri) and current national issues. During the meeting, the attendees expressed their collective support for the president’s administration and his commitment to the ongoing implementation of law enforcement in the country. The gathering received significant attention across multiple domestic media outlets, highlighting the government's engagement with veteran law enforcement leaders to address institutional stability and broader national security challenges within the framework of the current administration's governance priorities.",
